{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":80,"count":37,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L02-2-11\",\"问题\",\"問題\",\"问题\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"老師：你們有問題嗎？ 學生：沒有。謝謝老師。","pinyin":"Lǎoshī: Nǐmen yǒu wèntí ma? Xuéshēng: Méi yǒu. Xièxie lǎoshī.","english":"Teacher: Do you have any questions? Student: No. Thank you, teacher.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-11","sourceFront":"問題","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"沒問題。","pinyin":"Méi wèntí.","english":"No problem.","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-01","sourceFront":"明天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我想走路去一定沒問題。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiǎng zǒulù qù yídìng méi wèntí.","english":"I think it will certainly be okay going there on foot.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-2-01","sourceFront":"路/馬路","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L04-3-07\",\"牛奶\",\"牛奶\",\"牛奶\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你要果汁還是牛奶？","pinyin":"Nǐ yào guǒzhī háishì niúnǎi?","english":"Do you want juice or milk?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-3-07","sourceFront":"牛奶","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"牛奶 means milk: 牛(cow) + 奶(milk) → the milk that comes from a cow."},{"key":"[\"B1L06-2-09\",\"電腦\",\"電腦\",\"电脑\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我要買一部新電腦。","pinyin":"Wǒ yào mǎi yí bù xīn diànnǎo.","english":"I want to buy a new computer.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-09","sourceFront":"電腦","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我有手機，可是沒有電腦。","pinyin":"Wǒ yǒu shǒujī, kěshì méiyǒu diànnǎo.","english":"I have a cell phone, but I don’t have any computer.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-10","sourceFront":"手機","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"你不要常常在家上網、看電腦、玩手機，應該去運動。明天我有空，我們可以一起去騎腳踏車。","pinyin":"Nǐ búyào chángcháng zài jiā shàngwǎng, kàn diànnǎo, wán shǒujī, yīnggāi qù yùndòng. Míngtiān wǒ yǒukòng, wǒmen kěyǐ yìqǐ qù qí jiǎotàchē.","english":"Don’t surf the internet, use the computer or play on the cell phone at home often. You should go exercise. I am available tomorrow. We can go ride bikes together.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"電(electricity) + 腦(brain): an electric brain → a computer."},{"key":"[\"B1L07-3-11\",\"飛\",\"飛\",\"飞\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"機場附近的風景也很漂亮，我常常去看風景、看飛機。","pinyin":"Jīchǎng fùjìn de fēngjǐng yě hěn piàoliang, wǒ chángcháng qù kàn fēngjǐng, kàn fēijī.","english":"The scenery near the airport is beautiful; I often go there to see the view and watch the planes.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"A crane opens feathered wings wide and takes off → 飞(fly) is the shape of 飛(fly)."},{"key":"[\"B1L08-3-07\",\"旧\",\"舊\",\"旧\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我覺得有的舊東西很不錯，有的新東西也很有趣，我很喜歡看新車、新衣服，可是因為我的錢不多，所以我不常買。","pinyin":"Wǒ juéde yǒude jiù dōngxi hěn búcuò, yǒude xīn dōngxi yě hěn yǒuqù, wǒ hěn xǐhuān kàn xīn chē, xīn yīfu, kěshì yīnwèi wǒ de qián bù duō, suǒyǐ wǒ bù cháng mǎi.","english":"I think some old stuff is good and some new ones are interesting. I like to check the new car, new clothes out, but I do not have much money, so I don’t buy them often.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-3-01","sourceFront":"年輕","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L10-2-06\",\"嘴巴\",\"嘴（巴）\",\"嘴（巴）\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他的眼睛像爸爸，嘴巴像媽媽。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-2-14","sourceFront":"像","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當我們爬上那座高山，看見美麗的日出時，大家都驚訝地張大了嘴巴。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-16","sourceFront":"張","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有一些中式餐廳的桌上會擺一壺茶，要式客人覺得菜太油，就能喝口茶，解解嘴裡油膩的味道。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-53","sourceFront":"油","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"嘴(mouth) + 巴(suffix) → the mouth → 巴 just completes the word."},{"key":"[\"B1L11-3-04\",\"點菜\",\"點菜\",\"点菜\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A:我們要點幾盤菜？ B:今天是你的生日，我們多點幾盤吧。","pinyin":"A: Wǒmen yào diǎn jǐ pán cài? B: Jīntiān shì nǐ de shēngrì, wǒmen duō diǎn jǐ pán ba.","english":"A: How many dishes shall we order? B: Today is your birthday; let's order a few more dishes.","sourceCardId":"B1L11-3-05","sourceFront":"菜","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我去樓下的超市買點菜，待會兒做些家鄉菜給你嘗嘗。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-28","sourceFront":"待會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在這家餐廳，沒有人替你服務，點菜、拿碗筷等一切都得自助。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-02","sourceFront":"自助","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我和朋友到餐廳點了好多菜，最後沒吃完，只好打包回家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-32","sourceFront":"打包","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想要身體健康，最有效的方法就是多運動、少吃甜點、多吃蔬菜水果。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-23","sourceFront":"有效","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"算起來我們已經好久沒吃餃子了，買點兒麵粉、青菜和肉，回家包餃子吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-19","sourceFront":"麵粉","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Point (點) at the dish (菜) you want on the menu → that's ordering dishes."},{"key":"[\"B1L14-3-04\",\"警察\",\"警察\",\"警察\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我哥哥是警察，他每天工作十個小時。","pinyin":"Wǒ gēge shì jǐngchá, tā měitiān gōngzuò shí ge xiǎoshí.","english":"My older brother is a police officer; he works ten hours every day.","sourceCardId":"B1L14-3-04","sourceFront":"警察","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"小明從小就很勇敢，希望長大後能當一名好警察。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-06","sourceFront":"名","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的錢包丟了，裡面有護照、 信用卡，這件事很要緊，得馬上告訴警察","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-17","sourceFront":"要緊","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為有人喝酒後開車，造成了嚴重的交通意外，警察和救護車都趕來了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-34","sourceFront":"意外","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"金先生親眼見過警察在街上抓小偷，一個跑來跑去，一個追來追去，他覺得太刺激了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-16","sourceFront":"抓","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"警察的工作主要是保護民眾，讓好人不被傷害。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-17","sourceFront":"傷害","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他把所有的錢都給了女朋友，直到女朋友被警察抓了，才知道自己被騙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-04","sourceFront":"騙","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我父親是個警察，只要他負責的小組有重要任務時，就得出差一兩個星期。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-22","sourceFront":"任務","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這棟大樓有安全系統的設備，小偷進去就會自動發出警告的聲音通知警察。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-08","sourceFront":"自動","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"警察抓到小偷後就把他帶到警察局，關了起來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-18","sourceFront":"關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小偷：我又沒偷東西，為什麼抓我？ 警察：你先別動，只要看了商店攝影機錄下來的內容，就知道事實了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-28","sourceFront":"事實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天上午學校附近發生了車禍，經過警察處理後，現在交通已恢復正常。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-11","sourceFront":"已","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"路邊的攝影機錄到了房先生發生車禍的經過，讓警察順利抓到了害他受傷的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-02","sourceFront":"經過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"連警察都證明這個車禍是段老闆喝醉造成的，可是他仍然不肯承認。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-08","sourceFront":"仍然","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣，碰到緊急情況可撥110，請警察提供協助。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-10","sourceFront":"撥","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"警察亮出證件，叫那個正在吸毒的人乖乖把毒品交出來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-13","sourceFront":"亮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在路上撿到錢包可以交給警察，請他們幫忙處理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-03","sourceFront":"撿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"警(guard) + 察(examine) → one who guards and examines: the police."},{"key":"[\"B2L01-2-11\",\"赶快\",\"趕快\",\"赶快\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個活動不好玩，大家都希望趕快結束。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-2-12","sourceFront":"結束","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"他太晚起床，趕快刷了牙就去上班了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-07","sourceFront":"刷牙","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"何小姐走路回家時發覺有人跟在她後面，嚇得她趕快跑進便利商店，不敢回家了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-07","sourceFront":"發覺","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:如果現在有一千萬從天上掉下來，那該多好啊！ B:你別再做夢了，趕快回到現實吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-19","sourceFront":"現實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他在超市隨手買了瓶飲料，回家後才發現有效日期快到了，只好趕快喝完。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-22","sourceFront":"隨手","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下午颱風就要來了，看樣子得趕快去超市買點兒食物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-50","sourceFront":"看樣子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-1-09\",\"卧室\",\"臥室/臥房\",\"卧室/卧房\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你的臥室看起來真漂亮！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-19","sourceFront":"起來","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"陳小姐從小就愛史努比，所以臥房裡到處都是史努比的娃娃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-08","sourceFront":"從小","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣一般舊公寓的房子大約三十多坪，有客廳、廚房、一間浴室和三間臥房。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-19","sourceFront":"坪","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-2-02\",\"總是\",\"總是\",\"总是\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"王先生家離公司不遠，所以他總是走路去上班。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-02","sourceFront":"總是","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"上下班的時候，捷運站有很多人，總是很擠。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-05","sourceFront":"擠","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"爸爸下班以後，總是先洗個澡、喝個飲料，再吃晚飯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-09","sourceFront":"個","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我不曾一個人去旅行，總是參加團體旅遊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-07","sourceFront":"曾","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小高總是在別人面前表現得很有禮貌，不過回到家就完全變了一個樣子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-11","sourceFront":"面前","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"林媽媽總是給她的雙胞胎女兒穿同樣顏色、同樣大小的衣服。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-24","sourceFront":"同樣","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孔先生很重視生活品質，也很喜歡做家事，所以總是把家裡整理得乾乾淨淨的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-23","sourceFront":"整理","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在國外留學的時候，小史是我最好的兄弟，我們總是互相照顧、互相幫忙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-01","sourceFront":"兄弟","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張先生的個性很活潑、說話很幽默，跟他聊天總是很愉快。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-22","sourceFront":"幽默","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個明星對穿著很講究，總是花很多時間，研究什麼上衣配什麼長褲才好看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-01","sourceFront":"穿著","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"白小姐平時對穿著不怎麼講究，衣服穿來穿去總是那幾件。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-12","sourceFront":"平時","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的漢字考試總是不及格，經過三個月努力地練習，終於及格了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-18","sourceFront":"及格","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"跟張先生聊天時，總是我問一句，他答一句，真沒意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-12","sourceFront":"句","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當我遇到挫折時，他總是協助我克服困難，我們之間也建立了珍貴的友誼。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-15","sourceFront":"友誼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我妹妹很會做家事，她總是把房間整理得很整齊，連窗戶也擦得很乾淨。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-06","sourceFront":"整齊","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我父母每個月初寄錢給我，但我總是在月中就把錢花光了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-25","sourceFront":"初","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"古小姐做事的態度很積極，為了完成任務，總是很早就做好計畫，而且立刻實行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-16","sourceFront":"積極","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當鄰居生活遇到困難時，老馬總是主動提供協助，真令人感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-04","sourceFront":"令","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"週末的時候，火車站的賣票窗口總是排滿了人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-32","sourceFront":"窗口","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"冰店的生意好壞得看季節，冬天的生意總是不如夏天。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-42","sourceFront":"不如","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在學習新知識的過程中，總是會有開心與煩惱的時候。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-08","sourceFront":"過程","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他個性獨立，加上做事總是很細心，因此老闆很欣賞他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-24","sourceFront":"加上","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每年大學迎新時，學校總是會辦舞會歡迎大家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-11","sourceFront":"迎新","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司的午餐時間很短，因此同事們總是吃得很趕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-47","sourceFront":"趕","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他沖咖啡的技術很好，香味總是比別人沖的濃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-14","sourceFront":"沖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我每天騎車上班前，總是習慣先檢查摩托車的輪子正不正常。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-14","sourceFront":"輪子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這種巧克力是情人節最熱門的商品，總是一下子就賣光了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-06","sourceFront":"熱門","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以前我的小學老師總是親切地教導我們，讓我到現在還是很懷念她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-08","sourceFront":"懷念","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"說到興趣，我們全家的興趣都不同，總是你玩你的，我做我的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-01","sourceFront":"全家","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我叔叔總是說工作很累想休息，可是休了假之後又覺得無聊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-10","sourceFront":"休假","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"缺少運動的人總是說自己太忙，缺時間去活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-13","sour