Front":"家庭","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"沒有人能保證上了有名的大學，未來就一定快樂、幸福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-10","sourceFront":"保證","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我住的房子不大，也沒有很多錢，可是家人都很愛我， 讓我覺得很幸福、很滿足。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-17","sourceFront":"滿足","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他們特地穿上情侶裝出門，好像要告訴大家他們是幸福的情侶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-22","sourceFront":"情侶裝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他們特地穿上情侶裝出門，好像要告訴大家他們是幸福的情侶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-23","sourceFront":"情侶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我去參加朋友的婚禮，除了送紅包，還祝福他們事事如意、早生貴子、永遠幸福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-31","sourceFront":"早生貴子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小時候爺爺常陪我做功課、教我打球和釣魚，現在回想起那段時間，感覺真幸福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-26","sourceFront":"回想","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人人都希望自己的孩子有幸福的生活、美好的未來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-13","sourceFront":"人人","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人人都渴望浪漫的愛情和幸福的家庭，不過自由自在的單身生活也是不錯的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-29","sourceFront":"愛情","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他這幾年因為投資生意發了，婚姻生活也很幸福，運氣非常好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-31","sourceFront":"發","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對我來說，幸福就是在身邊有一群願意互相幫助的好友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-38","sourceFront":"群","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"喜劇中的男女主角，不論相處過程中碰到多少挫折，結局總是快樂又幸福的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-06","sourceFront":"喜劇","sourceBoo