,\"早日\",\"早日\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小高希望能早日退休，回鄉下照顧年紀大的父母。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-16","sourceFront":"早日","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"Combining 早(early) and 日(sun): 早日 means sooner."},{"key":"[\"B3L12-1-02\",\"面試\",\"面試\",\"面试\",\"Vi/N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"弟弟因為明天要去大學面試，緊張得整個晚上都睡不好","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-02","sourceFront":"面試","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"為了準備這次的面試，我看了很多相關資料，還不斷地練習面試時跟主管的對話。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-02","sourceFront":"面試","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:您好，歡迎您來面試。請問貴姓？ B:您好，我姓童，很高興今天能到貴公司來面試。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-03","sourceFront":"貴","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"一般來說，面試時要準備的相關文件包括個人基本資料、畢業證書等等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-14","sourceFront":"證書","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"面試時必須穿正式的服裝，跟老闆對話時，也應表現出客氣、 謙虛的態度。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-24","sourceFront":"應","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"站在老闆背後的那個人已經通過了面試，明天就要來上班了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-04","sourceFront":"背後","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如想通過那家企業的面試，就得先熟悉他們的產品特色與銷售方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-18","sourceFront":"如","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"妳去面試時稍微化妝一下，是一種禮貌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-40","sourceFront":"稍微","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家公司的工作條件和待遇都不錯，吸引不少年輕人來面試。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-15","sourceFront":"待遇","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 面(face) and 試(try): 面試 means interview."},{"key":"[\"B3L12-2-21\",\"通過\",\"通過\",\"通过\",\"Vpt\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小明順利通過了大學考試，今年就是一年級的新生了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-21","sourceFront":"通過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"站在老闆背後的那個人已經通過了面試，明天就要來上班了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-04","sourceFront":"背後","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如想通過那家企業的面試，就得先熟悉他們的產品特色與銷售方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-18","sourceFront":"如","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 通(through) and 過(pass): 通過 means pass through."},{"key":"[\"B4L01-1-04\",\"报到\",\"報到\",\"报到\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"到新公司報到以前，應先把個人的態度及觀念調整好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-04","sourceFront":"報到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L03-2-11\",\"采购\",\"採購\",\"采购\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"要是你想建議公司採購新設備，可以上網填採購單。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-11","sourceFront":"採購","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-1-22\",\"端\",\"端\",\"端\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那家餐廳的服務生很厲害，一隻手能端好幾個盤子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-22","sourceFront":"端","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"太太：要是你閒著沒事，就幫我泡一壺熱茶吧。先生：我哪裡閒？我馬上要開雲端會議了，可是忙得很呢！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-16","sourceFront":"閒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"在雲端科技發達的時代裡，人人都能夠透過網路交友、學習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-23","sourceFront":"發達","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"由於雲端科技的進步，人類的生活方式跟以往比起來有很大的差異。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-07","sourceFront":"由於","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"幸虧我把資料都存在雲端，要不然找不到隨身碟，怎麼開會呢？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-29","sourceFront":"幸虧","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"老師先把跟課程相關的學習資料上傳到雲端，讓學生預習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-27","sourceFront":"預習","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"明天的會議資料我已經上傳到雲端，請各位開會前先了解要討論的內容。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-23","sourceFront":"上傳","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"公司的會議資料都存在雲端，這樣又安全又方便，各部門也能隨時參考。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-01","sourceFront":"雲端","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我們到小張家時，他端了一盤切好的水果來招待我們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-29","sourceFront":"切","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A 立(stand) at the 耑(special) end of the line — the very tip. That spot is the 端(end)."},{"key":"[\"B4L05-1-53\",\"燃料\",\"燃料\",\"燃料\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他的夢想是利用水來當作交通工具的燃料，可是很多人認為不可能。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-53","sourceFront":"燃料","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L06-1-21\",\"等到\",\"等到\",\"等到\",\"Prep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"有好的投資機會就該好好掌握，不要等到事後才開始後悔。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-21","sourceFront":"等到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"今年學校的預算只夠修理宿舍的衛生設備，其他需要改善的只能等到明年了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-16","sourceFront":"預算","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L07-1-42\",\"实现\",\"實現\",\"实现\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"每天光說夢想，一點兒用都沒有，還是努力實現比較實在。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-42","sourceFront":"實現","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我愛看漫畫，在漫畫裡可以看見許多人們還沒實現的夢想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-05","sourceFront":"漫畫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L12-2-05\",\"導演\",\"導演\",\"导演\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"想導演一部以蟲子當作主角的電影，真不是件容易的事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-05","sourceFront":"導演","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"在指導演員的表達方式上，這位導演的經驗相當豐富。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-10","sourceFront":"指導","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那位演員有劇場表演的經驗，所以導演決定用他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-03","sourceFront":"劇場","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那部電影沒有結局，是導演要留給觀眾想像的空間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-32","sourceFront":"結局","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"李導演付出了十年的時間，終於拍出了一部好電影，得到大家的肯定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-18","sourceFront":"付出","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那個女演員演戲的樣子很自然，一點也不誇張，難怪導演很欣賞她。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-12","sourceFront":"自然","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這幾天電視上一連播了好幾部同一位導演拍的電影，一部比一部好看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-28","sourceFront":"播","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"美美剛進模特兒公司時，有一位導演找她演戲，沒想到就讓她變成了有名的明星。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-12","sourceFront":"進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:我希望將來能當一名很棒的導演。 B:我相信只要你不斷地努力，就能夢想成真的！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-22","sourceFront":"夢想成真","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"李導演因為拍那部電影而跟銀行借了不少錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-02","sourceFront":"而","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那個演員非常喜歡演戲，不管導演給他多麼難演的角色，他都願意試試看。",